##
Adopted from CodingBat

Given 2 ints, a and b, return true if one if them is 10 or if their sum is 10.

makes10(9, 10) → true
makes10(9, 9) → false
makes10(1, 9) → true
##

db makes10:num1:num2;
    cm num1 10;
        j e ret TRUE;
        j ne cm num2 10;
            j e ret TRUE;
            j ne add num1 num2;
            j ne cm num1 10;
                j e ret TRUE;
                j ne ret FALSE;
end makes10;

makes10 7 3;
mv RETF kernel;
sy launch kernel;